<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom share hits all-time high.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom share hits all-time high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom hit an all-time high of 7,120 escudos, up 121, adjusting to the New York share price after the stock rose sharply on Wall Street on Friday, which was a public holiday in Portugal, dealers said.</p>
</text>
